From: James Greig <3stripe@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 12:07:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/32] migrate: move wibwobworld, wibwobworld-iso,
 world-chatroom from modules-private to modules
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

These three microapps contain no sensitive data and belong in the main repo
so all commits are visible in a single git log. Remaining modules-private
modules (wibwob-primers, wibwob-prompts, wibwob-theme-phosphor) stay private.

Import paths unchanged — depth from modules/ is identical to modules-private/.
Cross-module import ../wibwobworld-iso/index.js resolves correctly since both
land in the same parent directory.

Includes E022 S01+S02 changes already committed to modules-private.
